  "description": "The Batch KM.24 is built for young riders ready to take the next leap — from sidewalks to singletrack. With a lightweight 6061 hydroformed alloy frame, kid-tuned geometry, and a 50mm travel suspension fork, this bike bridges the gap between fun and function, giving growing adventurers the tools they need to ride with confidence.\nThe simple and reliable Microshift 1x8 drivetrain offers all the gear range they need without any complexity, while mechanical disc brakes deliver consistent stopping power on dirt or pavement. Kenda 2.1” trail tires add grip without bulk, and the 24” wheels make handling responsive and fun. Whether they’re chasing trail time or just riding with friends, the KM.24 is built to grow with them — and built to ride like a real mountain bike.",
